Friday 2007 02 02 I released PeaZip 1.3:
- 7z frontend is updated, now supporting in-archive add/update and
delete operations for archive types supported through Pavlov/Myspace
7z executables;
- added support (create, browse, extract) for Matt Mahoney's PAQ8F and
Bill Pettis's PAQ8JD;
- some minor updates and fixes: extension not stripped in BZip2
compressed files, "Open with" dialog for Extract and run under Windows
when file association is not resolved.

PeaZip project home: http://sourceforge.net/projects/peazip/
Website: http://peazip.sourceforge.net/
Downloads (sources, documentation, Linux and Windows binaries)
http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?group_id=178996

